{"id":"memorial_101701","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial101700","label":"Memoirs · Letters from Girlfriend"},"label":"To J,","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"memorial_101702","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_101701_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_01_description","text":"It's been two days since you were drafted."},{"id":"memorial_101701_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_01_description","text":"What on earth is going on?"},{"id":"memorial_101701_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_01_description","text":"I hope you can tell me the truth if you receive this letter."},{"id":"memorial_101701_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_01_description","text":"Anyway, I miss you already."},{"id":"memorial_101701_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_01_description","text":"The TV keeps saying it's nothing serious, but I'm still worried about you."},{"id":"memorial_101701_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_01_description","text":"It's been ages since I've written a letter to someone, so I'm not quite sure what to write!"},{"id":"memorial_101701_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_01_description","text":"Promise me that you'll take good care of yourself, okay?"},{"id":"memorial_101701_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_01_description","text":"Looking forward to your reply!"},{"id":"memorial_101701_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_17_01_description","text":"Love you♡"}]}